cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Lokkhon, cite this benchmark release and the archived Medora software it scores."
title: "Lokkhon: a five-axis bilingual clinical safety benchmark for Bangladesh"
type: dataset
version: v0.1
date-released: "2026-08-21"
